&kp TAB           &kp SQT        &kp COMMA  &kp PERIOD  &kp P     &kp Y                                             &kp F         &kp G  &kp C  &kp R       &kp L   &kp SLASH
&kp LEFT_CONTROL  &kp A          &kp O      &kp E       &kp U     &kp I        &none             &none              &kp D         &kp H  &kp T  &kp N       &kp S   &kp MINUS
&kp LSHFT         &kp SEMICOLON  &kp Q      &kp J       &kp K     &kp X        &kp LEFT_BRACKET  &kp RIGHT_BRACKET  &kp B         &kp M  &kp W  &kp V       &kp Z   &lt 26 GRAVE
&kp LEFT_ALT      &mo 26         &kp LGUI   &kp ESCAPE  &kp BSPC  &to_english  &kp SPACE         &kp ENTER          &to_japanese  &none  &none  &kp DELETE  &mo 25  &mo 24
